#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:703
msgid ""
"Every engine a request reads is complete, and no engine is freed while "
"any request or connection cache holds it. The first holds because an "
"engine is built entirely before ``publish`` stores it; the second because "
"every reader holds an ``Arc``, and the engine is dropped only with its "
"last ``Arc``."
